@startuml
title Proposed Component Architecture — Draft
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

package "Next.js Web Application" {
  [Presentation / Routes] as UI
  [Authentication + Access Policy] as Auth
  [Assessment Module] as Assessment
  [Attempt / Submission Module] as Submission
  [HR Review / Release Module] as Review
  [Feedback / Learning Path Module] as Feedback
  [Reporting + Audit Module] as Reporting
  [Application Services] as AppSvc
  [Persistence Adapter] as Repo
}
database "PostgreSQL\n(Transactional app state)" as DB
component "FastAPI Adapter" as API
component "RubroRAG Pipeline" as Pipeline
database "Vector Index\n(if confirmed)" as VDB

UI --> Auth
UI --> Assessment
UI --> Submission
UI --> Review
UI --> Feedback
UI --> Reporting
Assessment --> AppSvc
Submission --> AppSvc
Review --> AppSvc
Feedback --> AppSvc
Reporting --> AppSvc
Auth --> AppSvc
AppSvc --> Repo
Repo --> DB
Feedback --> API
API --> Pipeline
Pipeline --> VDB

note right of Review
HR final decision and release
remain application-owned states.
AI output must not silently overwrite them.
end note

note bottom
Proposed module map. Confirm module boundaries and data stores
during F00/F01 and update based on implementation.
@enduml
